resolveLinux is operation
resolveLinux purpose "A path as posixpath.realpath gives it on Linux, as UTF-8 in a new heap block; its length stored at an address: absolute (from the working directory), `.` and empty names dropped, `..` taking off the name before it, each symbolic link replaced by what it holds (an absolute one starting again at `/`), at most 40 of them; names past one that is not there are kept as written"
