# ---------------------------------------------------------------- capability scopes at run time (D-38)
resourceOf is operation
resourceOf purpose "The scoped resource a scope line names after its first space: 1 net.tcp, 2 net.outbound, 3 fs.files, 4 process.programs, 5 ffi.libraries, 6 ffi.symbols; 0 when it is not a header"
resourceOf invariant none
resourceOf typeParameter none
resourceOf input line machine.Address copied
resourceOf input bytes Int64 copied
resourceOf output Int64
resourceOf outputOwnedBy none
resourceOf raises none
resourceOf effect use machine.memory
resourceOf uses memoryAccess
resourceOf memoryHeap false
resourceOf async false
resourceOf maxRecursion none
resourceOf label begin loopKind none
resourceOf label begin within none
resourceOf label eachByte loopKind while
resourceOf label eachByte within none
resourceOf label eachByte maxIterations bytes
resourceOf label checkByte loopKind none
resourceOf label checkByte within eachByte
resourceOf label advance loopKind none
resourceOf label advance within eachByte
resourceOf label notHeader loopKind none
resourceOf label notHeader within none
resourceOf label found loopKind none
resourceOf label found within none
resourceOf label giveTcp loopKind none
resourceOf label giveTcp within none
resourceOf label outboundCheck loopKind none
resourceOf label outboundCheck within none
resourceOf label giveOutbound loopKind none
resourceOf label giveOutbound within none
resourceOf label filesCheck loopKind none
resourceOf label filesCheck within none
resourceOf label giveFiles loopKind none
resourceOf label giveFiles within none
resourceOf label programsCheck loopKind none
resourceOf label programsCheck within none
resourceOf label givePrograms loopKind none
resourceOf label givePrograms within none
resourceOf label librariesCheck loopKind none
resourceOf label librariesCheck within none
resourceOf label giveLibraries loopKind none
resourceOf label giveLibraries within none
resourceOf label symbolsCheck loopKind none
resourceOf label symbolsCheck within none
resourceOf label giveSymbols loopKind none
resourceOf label giveSymbols within none
resourceOf label notHeaderEither loopKind none
resourceOf label notHeaderEither within none
resourceOf let at Int64 0 mutable
resourceOf let none0 Int64 0 immutable
resourceOf let tcp1 Int64 1 immutable
resourceOf let outbound2 Int64 2 immutable
resourceOf let files3 Int64 3 immutable
resourceOf let programs4 Int64 4 immutable
resourceOf let libraries5 Int64 5 immutable
resourceOf let symbols6 Int64 6 immutable
resourceOf let space Byte 32 immutable
resourceOf let tcp String "net.tcp" immutable
resourceOf let outbound String "net.outbound" immutable
resourceOf let fsFiles String "fs.files" immutable
resourceOf let programs String "process.programs" immutable
resourceOf let libraries String "ffi.libraries" immutable
resourceOf let symbols String "ffi.symbols" immutable
resourceOf let one Int64 1 immutable
resourceOf let zero32 Int32 0 immutable
resourceOf at begin goto eachByte
resourceOf at eachByte do endCheck
resourceOf at eachByte branch if atEnd goto notHeader else goto checkByte
resourceOf at checkByte do readByte
resourceOf at checkByte do spaceCheck
resourceOf at checkByte branch if isSpace goto found else goto advance
resourceOf at advance do nextByte
resourceOf at advance set at after
resourceOf at advance goto eachByte
resourceOf at notHeader return ok none0
resourceOf at found do startOf
resourceOf at found do findName
resourceOf at found do nameLength
resourceOf at found do findTcp
resourceOf at found do tcpLength
resourceOf at found do tcpCheck
resourceOf at found do tcpFound
resourceOf at found branch if tcpHit goto giveTcp else goto outboundCheck
resourceOf at giveTcp return ok tcp1
resourceOf at outboundCheck do findOutbound
resourceOf at outboundCheck do outboundLength
resourceOf at outboundCheck do checkOutbound
resourceOf at outboundCheck do outboundFound
resourceOf at outboundCheck branch if outboundHit goto giveOutbound else goto filesCheck
resourceOf at giveOutbound return ok outbound2
resourceOf at filesCheck do findFiles
resourceOf at filesCheck do filesLength
resourceOf at filesCheck do checkFiles
resourceOf at filesCheck do filesFound
resourceOf at filesCheck branch if filesHit goto giveFiles else goto programsCheck
resourceOf at giveFiles return ok files3
resourceOf at programsCheck do findPrograms
resourceOf at programsCheck do programsLength
resourceOf at programsCheck do checkPrograms
resourceOf at programsCheck do programsFound
resourceOf at programsCheck branch if programsHit goto givePrograms else goto librariesCheck
resourceOf at givePrograms return ok programs4
resourceOf at librariesCheck do findLibraries
resourceOf at librariesCheck do librariesLength
resourceOf at librariesCheck do checkLibraries
resourceOf at librariesCheck do librariesFound
resourceOf at librariesCheck branch if librariesHit goto giveLibraries else goto symbolsCheck
resourceOf at giveLibraries return ok libraries5
resourceOf at symbolsCheck do findSymbols
resourceOf at symbolsCheck do symbolsLength
resourceOf at symbolsCheck do checkSymbols
resourceOf at symbolsCheck do symbolsFound
resourceOf at symbolsCheck branch if symbolsHit goto giveSymbols else goto notHeaderEither
resourceOf at giveSymbols return ok symbols6
resourceOf at notHeaderEither return ok none0

