fsWriteAll purpose "fs.writeAll: a file's whole content, the file made if missing and emptied once it is known to be no one else's; the deadline is checked before it starts"
fsWriteAll invariant writesWholeFile "\"The file holds exactly the bytes, or busy while it is open, or the error\""
